        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 9.4 Data. Upon request, the Company shall supply the Union with data that displays the number of contract personnel utilized by Skills Management Code by Major Organization, so that compliance with all limitations identified in 9.3 can be monitored. The data shall include names, Skills Management Codes as applicable, organizations, and start dates.",
